Z||000010||84fierotrevor||12-03-2001||06:44 AM||||x box is doing bad ?<BR>not at my store we got a huge shippment of 40 today at 1oclock and had three left when we closed at 7:00 that's pretty good as for gamecube. the day we opend we had a bigass line waiting for it. more then xbox acctuly.<BR>but we havn't got anymore in sense then and probebly won't because I accadently broke street date, and sold a luigis mansion before relese date. So Nintendo of america is pissed at me now ! lol. They fined the store, Resulting in me getting a stage 2 write up. and won't give are store anymore gamecubes tell after christmas........<BR>ohwell seem's to only be hurting them.||||reg||1
