Z||000067||lou_dias||12-07-2001||02:26 PM||||And tell me what makes me smell like that?<BR>Where did I say one thing that you will need a shovel to move?<P>Remember a computer's power is not the sum of it's parts and they can't all work at the same time.  A real game machine has multiple buses so that it CAN do more things at once and usually each part runs it's own process.<P>What's the faster car given the same weight?<BR>an auto or a 5 speed with a 115 cu engine?  I guess it depends on the driver, right?<P>Well if one of your drivers is called Windows, I'll take the other one who's smaller and more efficient.||||reg||1
